        "id": 1390635
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-04T21:11:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In my testing result is not filled in with the new kernel driver on an error. So I could map errno when s_cmd-\u003eresult \u003d\u003d 0xff, and return -EECRESULT - s_cmd-\u003eresult otherwise.",
      "parentUuid": "8298db89_74b55f8c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 193,
        "startChar": 2,
